      "title": "Model memory reported by Ollama",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "description": "Values describe the configured model from /api/ps, not all container or host memory. CPU bytes estimate resident total minus VRAM. Zero GPU residency can be an actual CPU-mode response.",
